# Part of ZacUI. Shares ZacUI's namespace (_G.ZacUI, published by
# Core_Boot) and its saved variables (ZacUIDB.blessings, this paladin's
# own assignments in ZacUICharDB.blessings). Speaks the "PLPWR" addon
# channel, so PallyPower users in the group see and set the same
# assignments.

Data\BL_Data.lua
Core\BL_Core.lua
Core\BL_Comm.lua
Display\BL_Bar.lua
Display\BL_Grid.lua
Import\BL_Import.lua

# This part's settings pages load on demand with ZacUI's settings window:
